# Contract: cohort mint lists (FR-006-01)

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://unmask.local/schemas/006/cohort-1.json",
  "title": "unmask cohort list v1 (feature 006)",
  "description": "Mint lists for the 30+30 live experiment: screening pool, selected cohort A, liquid control B.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["version", "mint", "cohort", "source"],
  "properties": {
    "version": { "const": 1 },
    "mint": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[1-9A-HJ-NP-Za-km-z]{32,44}$" },
    "cohort": { "enum": ["pool_a", "a", "b"] },
    "source": { "enum": ["melt_high", "liquid", "liquid_draft", "screen_rank"] },
    "notes": { "type": "string" }
  }
}
```

One JSON object per line (JSONL). File-level rules (checked by
`scripts/cohort_check.py`, not by this schema): pool files hold ≥100 rows,
`cohort_b` files hold exactly 30 rows; mints unique within a file.
